    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346970/extras/6a5b3600ae8c6775c6656e86d31e15b9.poster.avif?t=1752869492\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346970/extras/6a5b3600ae8c6775c6656e86d31e15b9.webm?t=1752869492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346970/extras/6a5b3600ae8c6775c6656e86d31e15b9.mp4?t=1752869492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anatta</strong> is a 2.5D puzzle-platformer, sci-fi story. You play as a young girl waking up on a deserted beach without a clue how she ended up there. While exploring the island, you find an abandoned lighthouse and receive a distress signal \u2014 someone is trapped and desperately asking for help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenging obstacles, run, climb, jump, hide, interact with the environment, and solve unique puzzles to move forward. But be careful \u2014 danger lurks around every corner. Can you stay alive, uncover the dark secrets of the island, and figure out what is really going on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anatta</strong> offers not only old-school gameplay and a challenge to your wits but also an exploration of the philosophical question: <i>What does it mean to be yourself?</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346970/extras/6a5b3600ae8c6775c6656e86d31e15b9.poster.avif?t=1752869492\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346970/extras/6a5b3600ae8c6775c6656e86d31e15b9.webm?t=1752869492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346970/extras/6a5b3600ae8c6775c6656e86d31e15b9.mp4?t=1752869492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anatta</strong> is a 2.5D puzzle-platformer, sci-fi story. You play as a young girl waking up on a deserted beach without a clue how she ended up there. While exploring the island, you find an abandoned lighthouse and receive a distress signal \u2014 someone is trapped and desperately asking for help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenging obstacles, run, climb, jump, hide, interact with the environment, and solve unique puzzles to move forward. But be careful \u2014 danger lurks around every corner. Can you stay alive, uncover the dark secrets of the island, and figure out what is really going on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anatta</strong> offers not only old-school gameplay and a challenge to your wits but also an exploration of the philosophical question: <i>What does it mean to be yourself?</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Imagine waking up on a deserted shore without a clue how you ended up there. Anatta is a puzzle-platformer that takes you deep into the mysteries of an enigmatic island. Discover its haunting past and carve your path to salvation.",
